===Etymology===
{{inh+|en|enm|playce}}, {{m|enm|plays}}, from {{der|en|fro|plaiz}}, from {{der|en|LL.|platessa}}, from {{der|en|grc|πλατύς||broad}}. See {{m|en|platy-}}, {{m|en|plat}} and {{m|en|flat}}.

