===Noun===
{{en-noun|plaice|s}}

# Several similar marine [[flatfish]] of the [[righteye flounder]] family [[Pleuronectidae]]:
## ''[[Pleuronectes platessa]]'' ([[European plaice]]), commonly found in the [[North Sea]] and [[Irish Sea]], with smooth brown skin and red or orange spots.
##: {{syn|en|{{vern|plaice-fluke}}|{{vern|Dutch plaice}}}}
## {{taxlink|Hippoglossoides platessoides|species}} ({{vern|American plaice}}), of the North American [[Atlantic]].
## {{taxlink|Pleuronectes quadrituberculatus|species}} ({{vern|Alaska plaice}}), of the eastern North Pacific.
## {{taxlink|Acanthopsetta nadeshnyi|species}} ({{vern|scale-eye plaice}}), of the western North Pacific.
## {{taxlink|Liopsetta glacialis|species}} ({{vern|polar plaice}})

